{"book":9,"chapter":16,"rubric":"DATABASES / INDEXES, CTES, WINDOWS AND VIEWS / CHAPTER 16","slides":[{"title":"A query with a name","sub":"Chapter 16 · Views","short":"Intro","main":"A view is a saved named query that looks like a table.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Long query","Name","Like a table"],"captions":["A complex query with several joins gets copied into dozens of places","A view is a saved query under one name","We use the name like a table; it stores no data"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":14.0,"lines":["SELECT c.name, SUM(o.total)","FROM customers c JOIN orders o","  ON o.cust = c.id","WHERE o.status <> 'cancelled'","GROUP BY c.id;"],"lang":"sql","size":10.0,"lh":13.0,"w":340.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":290.0,"y":130.0,"text":"…and so in\nevery report","tone":"yellow","size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"v","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":200.0,"h":40.0,"text":"v_customer_totals","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":120.0,"text":"query saved under a name","size":9.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["SELECT * FROM v_customer_totals;"],"hl":[0],"lang":"sql","size":10.0,"lh":14.0,"w":340.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"text":"as if it were a table","tone":"green","size":10.0}]],"cues":[11.7,23.4]}]},{"title":"CREATE VIEW","sub":"Creating a view","short":"CREATE VIEW","main":"CREATE VIEW name AS SELECT … — save a query under a name.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Creating","Aliases","Dropping"],"captions":["CREATE VIEW name AS SELECT … — any query: JOIN, GROUP BY, functions","Columns take names from SELECT; calculated ones need aliases","DROP VIEW removes only the definition; tables are untouched"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":14.0,"lines":["CREATE VIEW v_customer_totals AS","SELECT c.id, c.name, SUM(o.total) AS spent","FROM customers c JOIN orders o ON o.cust = c.id","GROUP BY c.id;"],"hl":[0],"lang":"sql","size":9.5,"lh":13.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","